{%- style -%}
  .fm-terms-page {
    background-color: var(--fm-ivory);
    padding: clamp(50px, 8vw, 90px) 0;
  }
  .fm-terms-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 56px auto;
  }
  .fm-terms-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--fm-font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.6rem);
    color: var(--fm-forest);
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }
  .fm-terms-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--fm-border);
    padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .fm-terms-clause {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--fm-border-light);
  }
  .fm-terms-clause:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  .fm-terms-clause h2 {
    font-family: var(--fm-font-serif);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    color: var(--fm-forest);
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .fm-terms-clause p {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4F4D4A;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<div class="fm-terms-page">
  <div class="fm-container-narrow">
    <div class="fm-terms-header">
      <span class="fm-value-tagline">LEGAL AGREEMENT</span>
      <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.6rem; color: #55524E; line-height: 1.7;">Understanding your rights and obligations when using the Farsh Mahal platform.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="fm-terms-card">
      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>By visiting, browsing, or purchasing from <strong>https://farshmahal.com</strong>, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. References to "you", "your", and "customer" mean the end user; "we", "us", and "our" refer to Farsh Mahal by M & G Enterprise.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>2. General Conditions</h2>
        <p>The content of this website is for your general information and use only, subject to change without notice. Unauthorized use of this website may give rise to a claim for damages and/or be a criminal offence.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>3. User Account & Security</h2>
        <p>You may place orders as a guest or create an account. You are solely responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and notifying us immediately at farshmahal@gmail.com of any unauthorized activity.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>4. Accuracy of Information</h2>
        <p>You agree to provide current, complete, and accurate purchase, delivery, and account information for all transactions made at our store.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>5. Order Cancellation & Quantity Limits</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to refuse or limit any order placed with us. In the event of an order modification or cancellation, we will notify you via the email and phone number provided at the time the order was placed.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>6. Made-to-Order & Custom Rug Cancellations</h2>
        <p>Because custom and bespoke rugs are produced to individual specifications, cancellations and full refunds are strictly accommodated within <strong>24 hours of order placement</strong>. After 24 hours, raw material dyeing and hand-tufting commences.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>7. Product Specifications & Pricing</h2>
        <p>Prices are subject to change without prior notice. As each Farsh Mahal rug is individually hand-tufted by skilled artisans from natural wools, subtle variations in dimension, dye tone, and texture are hallmarks of authentic handmade craft.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>8. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
        <p>All designs, patterns, photography, typography, layouts, and copy on this site are owned by or licensed to Farsh Mahal and protected by copyright and intellectual property laws.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>9. Prohibited Uses</h2>
        <p>You are prohibited from using the site or its content for any unlawful purpose, to infringe upon intellectual property, to transmit malicious code, or to scrape content without explicit written consent.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="fm-terms-clause">
        <h2>10. Governing Law & Contact Information</h2>
        <p>These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. For any legal inquiries:</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Farsh Mahal by M & G Enterprise</strong><br>
          34, Krushnam Gokulam Society, B/H Avsar Party Plot Road, Mehsana, Gujarat, India 384002<br>
          Phone: +91 6351043735 | Email: farshmahal@gmail.com
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FM Terms & Conditions",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-fm-terms",
  "settings": [],
